to cover, conceal, hide, keep back, hold captive, RV. &c. &c.;
to stop, check, restrain, suppress, hinder, prevent from (abl. or inf.; rarely two acc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to exclude, Siddh.;
to prohibit, forbid, MBh.;
to withhold, R.; Kathās. &c.:
